HoennSeek_Text_JournalCyndaquilTowerHint::
	.string "Embers at night?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCyndaquilTowerTitle::
	.string "The tower's embers$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCyndaquilTowerRumor::
	.string "TYPHLOSION are said to bring their\nyoung to the BURNED TOWER in\lECRUTEAK at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCyndaquilTowerFoundText::
	.string "A TYPHLOSION and its CYNDAQUIL,\nwarming the pit of the BURNED\lTOWER. It still smells of smoke\ldown there.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCyndaquilTowerWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTotodileCoveHint::
	.string "A bait thief?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTotodileCoveTitle::
	.string "The lake's cove$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTotodileCoveRumor::
	.string "Something keeps stealing a\nfisherman's bait at the LAKE OF\lRAGE. A FERALIGATR is said to\lraise its young in the south cove.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTotodileCoveFoundText::
	.string "A FERALIGATR and its TOTODILE in\nthe LAKE OF RAGE's south cove. The\lbait thief was one of them\lall along!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTotodileCoveWhen::
	.string "In the morning, by day or in\nthe evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLaprasSongHint::
	.string "A cave song?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLaprasSongTitle::
	.string "LAPRAS's song$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLaprasSongRumor::
	.string "Every Friday, a LAPRAS is said to\nsing deep down in UNION CAVE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLaprasSongFoundText::
	.string "The LAPRAS of UNION CAVE. Its song\ncarried through the whole cave.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLaprasSongWhen::
	.string "All day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKiyoMachampHint::
	.string "A karate match?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKiyoMachampTitle::
	.string "KIYO's sparring$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKiyoMachampRumor::
	.string "The KARATE KING in MT. MORTAR is\nsaid to spar with a wild MACHAMP\levery morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKiyoMachampFoundText::
	.string "KIYO and the MACHAMP, trading\nblows at dawn. KIYO says it's the\lonly partner who never holds back.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKiyoMachampWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalScizorDuelHint::
	.string "Clashing blades?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalScizorDuelTitle::
	.string "The SCIZOR's duel$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalScizorDuelRumor::
	.string "Some evenings, blades clash behind\nthe trees in the NATIONAL PARK's\lnorth-east corner. Only on\lTUESDAYS, THURSDAYS and SATURDAYS.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalScizorDuelFoundText::
	.string "A SCIZOR fighting two SCYTHER for\nthe park's corner. It kept\lits ground.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalScizorDuelWhen::
	.string "In the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlowkingSageHint::
	.string "A well's riddles?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlowkingSageTitle::
	.string "SLOWKING's riddles$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlowkingSageRumor::
	.string "The SLOWKING down SLOWPOKE WELL is\nsaid to ask a different riddle\levery day of the week.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlowkingSageFoundText::
	.string "Seven riddles, seven answers, and\nthen a prophecy about a silver\lbird and the sea.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlowkingSageWhen::
	.string "A new riddle every day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRosettaHint::
	.string "New writing?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRosettaTitle::
	.string "The Rosetta line$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRosettaRumor::
	.string "A new line of writing turned up\ninside the RUINS OF ALPH, with\ldots on it like nothing the lab\lhas seen.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRosettaFoundText::
	.string "Braille and UNOWN letters on the\nsame line: AT NIGHT WE SPEAK.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownWordsHint::
	.string "Words at night?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownWordsTitle::
	.string "The night words$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownWordsRumor::
	.string "AT NIGHT WE SPEAK… The RUINS'\nWORDS chambers may say something\lnew after dark, a different word\leach night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownWordsFoundText::
	.string "A word for every night of the\nweek, glowing in the WORDS\lchambers. Each one names a place.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownWordsWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRingsHint::
	.string "Rings of UNOWN?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRingsTitle::
	.string "The UNOWN rings$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRingsRumor::
	.string "Hikers see UNOWN floating in a\ncircle at night, deep in the\lcaves. Always somewhere a night\lword names.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRingsFoundText::
	.string "Seven rings of UNOWN, seven pieces\nof an old tablet. Put together,\lthey spell ANCIENT.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownRingsWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownSanctumHint::
	.string "A split boulder?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownSanctumTitle::
	.string "The UNOWN sanctum$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownSanctumRumor::
	.string "The tablet's mark points to a\nboulder south of the RUINS'\lcentral chamber. By day it's just\la worn boulder.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownSanctumFoundText::
	.string "Under the boulder, a chamber with\na mural of every UNOWN, and an\linscription about SINJOH.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalUnownSanctumWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSneaselThiefHint::
	.string "An ice thief?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSneaselThiefTitle::
	.string "SNEASEL's hoard$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSneaselThiefRumor::
	.string "Items keep vanishing off the ice\ndeep down in the ICE PATH, only at\lnight. CLAIR thinks it's\la POKéMON.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSneaselThiefFoundText::
	.string "A SNEASEL snatching items off the\nICE PATH's ice, three times over.\lIts hoard was in a nook all along.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSneaselThiefWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLanturnLightHint::
	.string "A light at sea?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLanturnLightTitle::
	.string "The hidden lagoon$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLanturnLightRumor::
	.string "Sail past the WHIRL ISLANDS after\ndark and a light bobs on the\lwater, as if it wants to\lbe followed.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLanturnLightFoundText::
	.string "A LANTURN's light led all the way\nto a lagoon behind the ridge, with\lan old stone in it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLanturnLightWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAmpharosRescueHint::
	.string "AMPHY at night?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAmpharosRescueTitle::
	.string "AMPHAROS rescued$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAmpharosRescueRumor::
	.string "AMPHY won't settle at night. It\nstands at the top of the\lLIGHTHOUSE, watching a second\llight out at sea.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAmpharosRescueFoundText::
	.string "A second AMPHAROS, stranded on a\nsea rock off ROUTE 40. Three\lberries won it over, and it rode\lhome with you.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAmpharosRescueWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLugiaShrineHint::
	.string "A silver song?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLugiaShrineTitle::
	.string "LUGIA's shrine$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLugiaShrineRumor::
	.string "Something huge and silver was seen\nsinging off ROUTE 41, and the\llagoon stone has four hollows.\lFeathers, maybe?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalLugiaShrineFoundText::
	.string "Three feathers and the SILVER WING\nin the lagoon stone. The sea\lflashed white, and LUGIA's\lsong answered.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBeastsHint::
	.string "Roaming beasts?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBeastsTitle::
	.string "RAIKOU and ENTEI$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBeastsRumor::
	.string "The beasts that fled the BURNED\nTOWER roam all over JOHTO. EUSINE\lin CELADON wants to hear when\lyou've met them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBeastsFoundText::
	.string "RAIKOU and ENTEI, both met face to\nface. They never stay anywhere\lfor long.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoohDawnHint::
	.string "A rainbow at dawn?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoohDawnTitle::
	.string "HO-OH at dawn$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoohDawnRumor::
	.string "The TIN TOWER's sages say HO-OH\ncomes back to the roof at dawn,\lonce every sign is in place.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoohDawnFoundText::
	.string "HO-OH on the TIN TOWER's roof at\nsunrise. The whole sky turned the\lcolors of its wings.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoohDawnWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiOfferingsHint::
	.string "Empty dishes?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiOfferingsTitle::
	.string "Forest offerings$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiOfferingsRumor::
	.string "The ILEX FOREST shrine has three\nempty dishes. Something grown in\lthree forests might fill them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiOfferingsFoundText::
	.string "Berries grown in ILEX FOREST,\nVIRIDIAN FOREST and PETALBURG\lWOODS, set before the shrine.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoneyTrailHint::
	.string "Honey on a pine?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoneyTrailTitle::
	.string "The moon hollow$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoneyTrailRumor::
	.string "TEDDIURSA are said to come for\nhoney spread on an old pine at the\lbottom of ROUTE 45.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoneyTrailFoundText::
	.string "The URSARING mother led you up the\ncliff at night, to a hollow where\lthe bears watch the moon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalHoneyTrailWhen::
	.string "In the morning or at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDunsparceBurrowHint::
	.string "Holes that move?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDunsparceBurrowTitle::
	.string "DUNSPARCE's burrow$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDunsparceBurrowRumor::
	.string "DARK CAVE's holes are said to move\nwith the time of day. Something\lkeeps digging down there.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDunsparceBurrowFoundText::
	.string "A DUNSPARCE that dug and dug until\nit had three segments. The burrow\lgoes deeper every visit.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDunsparceBurrowWhen::
	.string "Its hole moves with the time\nof day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRayquazaTowerHint::
	.string "A JADE ORB?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRayquazaTowerTitle::
	.string "RAYQUAZA at noon$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRayquazaTowerRumor::
	.string "SKY PILLAR's mural shows a green\norb. Set into the right tower at\lnoon, it might call the sky's\lguardian down.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRayquazaTowerFoundText::
	.string "RAYQUAZA, coiled around the\nEMBEDDED TOWER at high noon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRayquazaTowerWhen::
	.string "At noon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRegiDoorsHint::
	.string "Sealed caves?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRegiDoorsTitle::
	.string "The REGI doors$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRegiDoorsRumor::
	.string "Up at the SINJOH RUINS, boulders\nseal the caves in the cliffs,\lcarved with braille older than any\lwe know.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRegiDoorsFoundText::
	.string "All three boulders rolled aside.\nSomething big stirred behind\leach one.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDailySwarmHint::
	.string "Today's swarm?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDailySwarmTitle::
	.string "The daily swarm$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDailySwarmRumor::
	.string "Every day, one kind of POKéMON\nswarms on one route, in JOHTO,\lKANTO or HOENN. The TV news and\lPROF. OAK's show on the radio\lsay where.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDailySwarmFoundText::
	.string "A whole route full of one kind of\nPOKéMON! A different one swarms\levery day, and some are found\lnowhere else.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDailySwarmWhen::
	.string "Today: {STR_VAR_1} on {STR_VAR_2}.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBulbasaurGardenHint::
	.string "A secret garden?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBulbasaurGardenTitle::
	.string "BULBASAUR's garden$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBulbasaurGardenRumor::
	.string "BILL's grandpa says BULBASAUR meet\nin a garden behind his house. In\lthe morning, slip through the\ltrees above the cape.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBulbasaurGardenFoundText::
	.string "A whole garden of BULBASAUR, and\nthree of them blooming into\lIVYSAUR at once.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBulbasaurGardenWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCharmanderRainHint::
	.string "A flame in rain?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCharmanderRainTitle::
	.string "CHARMANDER's wait$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCharmanderRainRumor::
	.string "The CERULEAN NURSE saw a\nCHARMANDER by NUGGET BRIDGE at\ldusk, waiting in the rain.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCharmanderRainFoundText::
	.string "A CHARMANDER still waiting for the\ntrainer who left it. It has a new\ltrainer now.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCharmanderRainWhen::
	.string "In the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSquirtleSquadHint::
	.string "Shady SQUIRTLE?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSquirtleSquadTitle::
	.string "The SQUIRTLE SQUAD$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSquirtleSquadRumor::
	.string "A gang of SQUIRTLE plays by ROUTE\n6's pond, mornings and days. Their\lleader wears sunglasses!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSquirtleSquadFoundText::
	.string "The SQUIRTLE SQUAD's pitfall,\ntheir hideout, and a night fire in\lVERMILION that they put out.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSquirtleSquadWhen::
	.string "In the morning, by day or\nat night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalGengarShadowHint::
	.string "A grinning shadow?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalGengarShadowTitle::
	.string "The shadow chase$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalGengarShadowRumor::
	.string "On some nights in LAVENDER TOWN,\npeople swear their own shadows\lgrin at them. Follow where\lit points.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalGengarShadowFoundText::
	.string "A GENGAR hiding in your shadow,\nfrom LAVENDER all the way to the\lRADIO TOWER.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalGengarShadowWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZapdosStormHint::
	.string "A storm feather?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZapdosStormTitle::
	.string "ZAPDOS's roost$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZapdosStormRumor::
	.string "When a thunderstorm hits ROUTE 10,\nlightning strikes the POWER PLANT.\lThe MANAGER keeps what it\lleaves behind.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZapdosStormFoundText::
	.string "ZAPDOS came down to its roost on\nROUTE 10 when the THUNDER FEATHER\lcalled it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZapdosStormWhen::
	.string "Thunderstorm day at ROUTE 10's\nPOWER PLANT.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalArticunoRoostHint::
	.string "An ice feather?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalArticunoRoostTitle::
	.string "ARTICUNO's roost$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalArticunoRoostRumor::
	.string "BILL says each of the three birds\nhas a roost. ARTICUNO's is deep in\lthe SEAFOAM ISLANDS, and a FROST\lFEATHER might call it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalArticunoRoostFoundText::
	.string "ARTICUNO landed in the SEAFOAM\nISLANDS, drawn down by the\lFROST FEATHER.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresRoostHint::
	.string "A fire feather?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresRoostTitle::
	.string "MOLTRES's roost$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresRoostRumor::
	.string "BILL says MOLTRES roosts high up\non MT. SILVER. A FLAME FEATHER\lmight bring it down.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresRoostFoundText::
	.string "MOLTRES came back to its roost on\nMT. SILVER for the FLAME FEATHER.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalOnixBoreHint::
	.string "Tunnel holes?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalOnixBoreTitle::
	.string "The ONIX bore$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalOnixBoreRumor::
	.string "A different hole opens in ROCK\nTUNNEL every night, and the ground\lrumbles once. Something huge is\lboring through the rock.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalOnixBoreFoundText::
	.string "A shining ONIX, deep in the\ntunnels it bores. It moves its\lhole every night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalOnixBoreWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTangelaVinesHint::
	.string "Vines that move?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTangelaVinesTitle::
	.string "TANGELA's islet$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTangelaVinesRumor::
	.string "On ROUTE 21's little islet, the\nvines move aside in the morning.\lSomething is hiding in them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTangelaVinesFoundText::
	.string "A TANGELA living in the vines on\nROUTE 21's islet.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTangelaVinesWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKangaBabyHint::
	.string "A lost baby?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKangaBabyTitle::
	.string "The lost baby$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKangaBabyRumor::
	.string "Evenings, something small cries on\nthe SAFARI ZONE's BEACH. And a\lKANGASKHAN mother paces with an\lempty pouch.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKangaBabyFoundText::
	.string "A baby KANGASKHAN, walked all the\nway back to its mother's pouch.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalKangaBabyWhen::
	.string "In the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTaurosStampedeHint::
	.string "A stampede?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTaurosStampedeTitle::
	.string "TAUROS stampede$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTaurosStampedeRumor::
	.string "Monday mornings, a herd of TAUROS\ncharges back and forth up in the\lSAFARI ZONE's highland.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTaurosStampedeFoundText::
	.string "Through the stampede to the lead\nbull, a TAUROS from\lfar-off PALDEA.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTaurosStampedeWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSeafoamTitansHint::
	.string "Fog into storm?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSeafoamTitansTitle::
	.string "The SEAFOAM titans$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSeafoamTitansRumor::
	.string "Some days the fog over the SEAFOAM\nwaters is thick as soup. The right\lORB is said to turn it into a\lstorm, or a drought.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSeafoamTitansFoundText::
	.string "KYOGRE and GROUDON, asleep under\nthe SEAFOAM ISLANDS, woken by\lthe ORBS.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSeafoamTitansWhen::
	.string "Fog day on the SEAFOAM waters.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalEnigmaLatiHint::
	.string "Glowing sparks?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalEnigmaLatiTitle::
	.string "The ENIGMA STONE$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalEnigmaLatiRumor::
	.string "Red and blue sparkles in SOUTHERN\nISLAND's grass, warm like embers.\lThe PEWTER MUSEUM would know what\lthey are.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalEnigmaLatiFoundText::
	.string "Three shards joined into the\nENIGMA STONE. SOUTHERN ISLAND's\lother guardian answers to it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMansionJournalHint::
	.string "Burned pages?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMansionJournalTitle::
	.string "FUJI's journal$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMansionJournalRumor::
	.string "Pages of the burned MANSION's\njournal keep turning up all over\lKANTO. They're signed FUJI.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMansionJournalFoundText::
	.string "Six pages of MR. FUJI's journal,\nand the POKéMON they were about,\lin CERULEAN's deepest cave.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMewBlurHint::
	.string "A pink blur?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMewBlurTitle::
	.string "The pink blur$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMewBlurRumor::
	.string "Something pink zips through the\ngrass at first light, on ROUTE 1,\lROUTE 22, even HOENN's ROUTE 101!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMewBlurFoundText::
	.string "A MEW at dawn, gone before you\ncould look twice. It left a scrap\lof an old sea map behind.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMewBlurWhen::
	.string "At first light.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiMemoryHint::
	.string "A road remembered?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiMemoryTitle::
	.string "Celebi's memory$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiMemoryRumor::
	.string "Walk ROUTE 22 with CELEBI\nfollowing you, healthy and happy.\lIt remembers that road, and a boy\lwho stood on it with his father.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCelebiMemoryFoundText::
	.string "CELEBI showed you young SILVER and\nGIOVANNI on ROUTE 22, years ago.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalJirachiWishesHint::
	.string "Three wishes?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalJirachiWishesTitle::
	.string "The white rock$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalJirachiWishesRumor::
	.string "Three wishes on three falling\nstars, and the white rock at MT.\lMOON is said to answer, on the\lnight the CLEFAIRY dance.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalJirachiWishesFoundText::
	.string "JIRACHI, woken by three wishes,\nlanding in MT. MOON's pond.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalJirachiWishesWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBrockWeekendsHint::
	.string "BROCK's weekends?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBrockWeekendsTitle::
	.string "BROCK's weekends$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBrockWeekendsRumor::
	.string "BROCK spends his weekends at the\nPEWTER MUSEUM. Talk to him there:\lhe has something on his mind, and\lit takes a few weekends to tell.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBrockWeekendsFoundText::
	.string "BROCK's breeder dream: MT. MOON,\nthe DAY CARE, and an ONIX DOLL\lfrom his family.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBrockWeekendsWhen::
	.string "All day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMistyWeekendsHint::
	.string "MISTY's weekends?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMistyWeekendsTitle::
	.string "MISTY's water show$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMistyWeekendsRumor::
	.string "MISTY swims to the SEAFOAM ISLANDS\nevery weekend. She's planning\lsomething new for her gym's water\lshow, and she could use some help.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMistyWeekendsFoundText::
	.string "MISTY's new finale: the SEAFOAM\ncurrent, a rehearsal in her gym,\land a STARMIE DOLL from\lher sisters.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMistyWeekendsWhen::
	.string "All day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBlueWeekendsHint::
	.string "BLUE's weekends?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBlueWeekendsTitle::
	.string "BLUE goes home$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBlueWeekendsRumor::
	.string "BLUE trains on ROUTE 22 every\nweekend. His grandpa and his\lsister say he never visits PALLET\lTOWN. Maybe he needs someone to\lcome along.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBlueWeekendsFoundText::
	.string "BLUE went home to PALLET TOWN:\nDAISY's stories, a talk in OAK's\llab, and a PIDGEOT DOLL.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBlueWeekendsWhen::
	.string "All day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMudkipPondHint::
	.string "A pond at dawn?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMudkipPondTitle::
	.string "The MUDKIP pond$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMudkipPondRumor::
	.string "Every morning, a SWAMPERT brings\ntwo MUDKIP to a pond on ROUTE 102\lto practice. When they all dive,\lrain is coming.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMudkipPondFoundText::
	.string "A SWAMPERT teaching its MUDKIP to\ndive. The rain came right after,\ljust like they said.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMudkipPondWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRaltsGuardHint::
	.string "A guarded RALTS?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRaltsGuardTitle::
	.string "The RALTS's trust$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRaltsGuardRumor::
	.string "Every morning, a GARDEVOIR guards\na RALTS by the tall grass near\lPETALBURG. Run up to them and\lthey vanish!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRaltsGuardFoundText::
	.string "Three slow, quiet mornings, and\nthe RALTS chose to come along.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalRaltsGuardWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMunchlaxNapHint::
	.string "A sleeper in ash?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMunchlaxNapTitle::
	.string "The ash grotto$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMunchlaxNapRumor::
	.string "A MUNCHLAX has been asleep in the\ntrees by ROUTE 113's first ash\lfields for weeks. The glassblower\lmight know a tune.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMunchlaxNapFoundText::
	.string "The GLASS FLUTE woke the MUNCHLAX,\nand the gap it slept in led to a\lgrotto under the ash.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSpindaDanceHint::
	.string "A dance in ash?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSpindaDanceTitle::
	.string "SPINDA's dance$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSpindaDanceRumor::
	.string "Some mornings a SPINDA dances in\nthe ash on ROUTE 113, up by the\lsign. Only once a week!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSpindaDanceFoundText::
	.string "A SPINDA dancing in the ash. Every\nstep was different.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSpindaDanceWhen::
	.string "Some morning this week.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlakingNoonHint::
	.string "A noon sleeper?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlakingNoonTitle::
	.string "SLAKING's clearing$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlakingNoonRumor::
	.string "A SLAKING sleeps in a gap in\nPETALBURG WOODS' trees. It only\lever gets up at noon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlakingNoonFoundText::
	.string "The SLAKING woke at noon, and\nbehind it was NORMAN's old\ltraining clearing.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalSlakingNoonWhen::
	.string "At noon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTropiusOrchardHint::
	.string "Fruit at sunrise?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTropiusOrchardTitle::
	.string "TROPIUS orchard$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTropiusOrchardRumor::
	.string "TROPIUS shakes fruit off its neck\nwhen the sun comes up. One was\lseen flying into the trees under\lthe FORTREE sign.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTropiusOrchardFoundText::
	.string "A hidden orchard behind a tree\ntrunk on ROUTE 119, with a TROPIUS\land a tree full of fruit.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTropiusOrchardWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalFeebasPondHint::
	.string "A plain fish?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalFeebasPondTitle::
	.string "The mirror pool$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalFeebasPondRumor::
	.string "Nobody looks twice at the fish in\na little pond up ROUTE 119. It's\lsaid to bite only after dark.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalFeebasPondFoundText::
	.string "A FEEBAS in the mirror pool. Its\nscales shine like a prism if you\llook closely.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalFeebasPondWhen::
	.string "In the evening or at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZangooseFeudHint::
	.string "A Sunday fight?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZangooseFeudTitle::
	.string "The island feud$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZangooseFeudRumor::
	.string "Every Sunday night, on the same\nisland in ROUTE 114's lake,\lZANGOOSE and SEVIPER have the\lsame fight.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZangooseFeudFoundText::
	.string "ZANGOOSE and SEVIPER, mid-fight on\nthe island. They turned on\lyou together!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalZangooseFeudWhen::
	.string "In the evening or at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAbsolRidgeHint::
	.string "A white shape?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAbsolRidgeTitle::
	.string "ABSOL on the ridge$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAbsolRidgeRumor::
	.string "A white POKéMON stands on ROUTE\n120's ridge when the storm\lrolls in.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAbsolRidgeFoundText::
	.string "ABSOL on the ridge in the storm.\nIt only roams ROUTE 120 on\lstormy nights.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAbsolRidgeWhen::
	.string "Storm day on ROUTE 120! In the\nevening or at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalWailordStraitHint::
	.string "A sleeping whale?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalWailordStraitTitle::
	.string "The atoll$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalWailordStraitRumor::
	.string "A WAILORD sleeps in the rocks off\nROUTE 131. It's always listening\lfor something.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalWailordStraitFoundText::
	.string "The WAILORD woke and swam off, and\nthe strait it blocked led to a\lring of sand around a lagoon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalChimechoChimesHint::
	.string "Chimes at night?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalChimechoChimesTitle::
	.string "MT. PYRE's chimes$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalChimechoChimesRumor::
	.string "On still nights, the chimes at MT.\nPYRE's summit ring by themselves.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalChimechoChimesFoundText::
	.string "A CHIMECHO, ringing between the\ngraves. The sound led right to it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalChimechoChimesWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAltariaChorusHint::
	.string "Singing on top?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAltariaChorusTitle::
	.string "The ALTARIA chorus$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAltariaChorusRumor::
	.string "Saturday mornings, singing comes\nfrom the top of METEOR FALLS.\lALTARIA, surely.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAltariaChorusFoundText::
	.string "A whole chorus of ALTARIA on the\nclifftop, and one of them shone a\ldifferent color.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalAltariaChorusWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBagonLeapHint::
	.string "A leap at dawn?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBagonLeapTitle::
	.string "BAGON's leap$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBagonLeapRumor::
	.string "A BAGON lives deep in METEOR\nFALLS. Every morning it jumps off\la ledge, trying to fly.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBagonLeapFoundText::
	.string "The BAGON's leap, again and again.\nIt hasn't flown yet, but it never\lgives up.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalBagonLeapWhen::
	.string "In the morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMetagrossFusionHint::
	.string "Glowing stones?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMetagrossFusionTitle::
	.string "The METAGROSS$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMetagrossFusionRumor::
	.string "Once a week, the meteorite pieces\nin STEVEN's cave at METEOR FALLS\lare said to glow at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMetagrossFusionFoundText::
	.string "Two METANG fused into a METAGROSS\nin STEVEN's cave, in a flash\lof white.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMetagrossFusionWhen::
	.string "One night this week.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDesertSongHint::
	.string "A singing desert?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDesertSongTitle::
	.string "The desert's song$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDesertSongRumor::
	.string "The desert on ROUTE 111 sings at\nsunset: a low hum rolls over the\ldunes, only in the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDesertSongFoundText::
	.string "A TRAPINCH's tracks, a hollow\nwhere the sand drains, and a\lVIBRAVA that gave you its\lSINGING SAND.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDesertSongWhen::
	.string "In the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMirageFlygonHint::
	.string "A tower's song?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMirageFlygonTitle::
	.string "The MIRAGE TOWER$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMirageFlygonRumor::
	.string "A FLYGON is said to have sung at\nthe top of the MIRAGE TOWER, long\lago. A chime of desert sand might\lraise it again.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMirageFlygonFoundText::
	.string "The SAND CHIME raised the MIRAGE\nTOWER, and FLYGON was waiting at\lthe top.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMirageFlygonWhen::
	.string "In the evening.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalNightDiveHint::
	.string "Deep-sea lights?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalNightDiveTitle::
	.string "The trench$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalNightDiveRumor::
	.string "After dark, the deep water off\nROUTE 124 glows. A CHINCHOU's\llight waits on the seabed.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalNightDiveFoundText::
	.string "The CHINCHOU lights led to a crack\nin the seabed, and a trench black\las ink.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalNightDiveWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTrenchGuardiansHint::
	.string "Trench guardians?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTrenchGuardiansTitle::
	.string "The mound's door$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTrenchGuardiansRumor::
	.string "Something different guards the\nbottom of ROUTE 124's trench each\lday: HUNTAIL, GOREBYSS\lor RELICANTH.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTrenchGuardiansFoundText::
	.string "All three guardians met, and the\nmound at the bottom of the\ltrench opened.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalTrenchGuardiansWhen::
	.string "A different guardian every day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceChamberHint::
	.string "A hole in the ice?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceChamberTitle::
	.string "The ice chamber$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceChamberRumor::
	.string "When the tide goes out, a hole is\nsaid to open in SHOAL CAVE's\lice room.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceChamberFoundText::
	.string "Down the hole at low tide, a\nsliding-ice chamber, and a GLALIE\lon a frozen pool.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceChamberWhen::
	.string "Any time but night, at low tide.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceFroslassHint::
	.string "A face in the ice?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceFroslassTitle::
	.string "The pillar chase$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceFroslassRumor::
	.string "Something cold walks the ice\nchamber at night when the tide is\lout. You see her in the ice before\lyou see her.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceFroslassFoundText::
	.string "A FROSLASS hiding from pillar to\npillar, and a FROST FEATHER frozen\lbehind her.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalIceFroslassWhen::
	.string "At night, at low tide.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCastformHint::
	.string "A weather rider?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCastformTitle::
	.string "CASTFORM$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCastformRumor::
	.string "CASTFORM only show themselves when\nthe weather turns, around ROUTES\l119, 120 and 123.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCastformFoundText::
	.string "A CASTFORM, riding the weather\nnear the WEATHER INSTITUTE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalCastformWhen::
	.string "The weather turns on ROUTE 119,\n120 or 123 today.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMasquerainHint::
	.string "Rain on the pond?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMasquerainTitle::
	.string "MASQUERAIN$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMasquerainRumor::
	.string "In HOENN, MASQUERAIN are said to\nflutter out of the grass only on\lrainy days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMasquerainFoundText::
	.string "A MASQUERAIN, out in the rain. It\nonly comes when the sky opens.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMasquerainWhen::
	.string "Rain is due on a HOENN\nroute today.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresFlyoverHint::
	.string "A burning shadow?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresFlyoverTitle::
	.string "The flyover$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresFlyoverRumor::
	.string "A burning shadow sometimes sweeps\nover the ash on ROUTE 113. The ash\lgoes warm right before it comes!$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalMoltresFlyoverFoundText::
	.string "MOLTRES, sweeping low over ROUTE\n113. It dropped a FLAME FEATHER in\lthe ash.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDeoxysSignalHint::
	.string "A signal?$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDeoxysSignalTitle::
	.string "The space signal$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDeoxysSignalRumor::
	.string "MOSSDEEP's SPACE CENTER is picking\nup a signal from space, only\lat night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDeoxysSignalFoundText::
	.string "The signal, logged night after\nnight. It came with a ticket to a\lfar island.$"

HoennSeek_Text_JournalDeoxysSignalWhen::
	.string "At night.$"

